## PHASE 7: Integration & Testing

### Bước 7.1: Cập nhật training loop

**File**: [gaussian_mapper.cpp](file:///media/tam/DATA/3D/CG-photo/src/gaussian_mapper.cpp)

**Trong trainForOneIteration(), sau khi có rendered image**:

```cpp
// UncertPhoto-SLAM: Update per-Gaussian uncertainty tracking
if (this->uncertainty_config_.render_uncertainty_map) {
    // Get visibility mask from rendering
    auto visible_mask = radii > 0;  // Gaussians that contributed to this frame
    
    // Compute per-Gaussian photometric residual contribution
    // This is approximated by projecting pixel residuals back to Gaussians
    auto residual_map = torch::abs(rendered - gt_image);
    auto mean_residual = residual_map.mean();  // Simplified: use global mean
    auto per_gaussian_residual = mean_residual.expand({visible_mask.size(0)});
    
    pGaussian_Model_->updatePhotometricResidual(visible_mask, per_gaussian_residual);
    
    // For RGB-D: Update depth stability
    if (has_gt_depth) {
        auto depth_diff_map = depth - gt_depth;
        // Similar backprojection to per-Gaussian
        pGaussian_Model_->updateDepthStability(visible_mask, depth_diff);
    }
    
    // Periodically update combined uncertainty
    if (iteration % uncertainty_config_.uncertainty_update_interval == 0) {
        pGaussian_Model_->computeCombinedUncertainty();
    }
}
```

